TITLE 1D transport with exchange; query alkalinity solution 3 at step 10

SOLUTION 0
    pH 7.0
    units mol/kgw

SOLUTION 1-10
    pH 7.0
    units mol/kgw
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

SOLUTION 11
    pH 7.0
    units mol/kgw
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -initial_time 0
    -print_frequency 10
    -punch_frequency 10
    -warnings false

END
